# Everything is LF. The code is edited on Windows and executed on Linux; a
# shell script that picks up CRLF fails there with "set: pipefail: invalid
# option name" (it killed a GPU job on 2026-10-19). tests/test_repo_hygiene.py
# enforces the same rule on the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.docx binary
*.key binary
